f\">   55 haploid\r\nindividuals</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 10pt;line-height:115%;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">   10 codominant loci</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 10pt;line-height:115%;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"> </p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 10pt;line-height:115%;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">Population information:</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 10pt;line-height:115%;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"> </p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 10pt;line-height:115%;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">    1 stratum - Pop</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 10pt;line-height:115%;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">    3 populations\r\ndefined - Hybrid, Heirloom, Grape</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 10pt;line-height:115%;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><b style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">&gt;pop(martin22)&lt;-martin22$other$epid</b></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 10pt;line-height:115%;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><b style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">&gt;dapc.martin22&lt;-dapc(martin22,var.contrib=TRUE,scale=FALSE,n.pca=10,n.da=nPop(martin22)-1)</b></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 10pt;line-height:115%;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">Error in dapc.genind(martin22, var.contrib = TRUE, scale =\r\nFALSE, n.pca = 10,  : </p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 10pt;line-height:115%;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">  x does not include\r\npre-defined populations, and `pop&#39; is not provided</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 10pt;line-height:115%;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><b style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">&g